The '''Confederal Strategic Support Force''' ('''CSSF'''; {{Lang-bl|Fuercia de Soporte Estratéxico Confederales|}}) is the [[W:Cyberwarfare|cyber]], [[W:Influence operations|political]], and [[W:Electronic warfare|electronic warfare]] force and the 4th [[w:Military branch|branch]] of the [[Confederal Armed Forces]] (CAF) of the [[Baliscan Confederation]]. The CSSF aims to improve the army's ability to fight "informationized conflicts" and enhance Balisca's [[W:Power projection|power projection]] capabilities in space and [[W:Cyberspace|cyberspace]]. 

